      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "On the Roto Seating Merry-Go-Round, children sit on a yellow moulded seat under a steel canopy frame while the unit turns. The canopy frame gives the ride a distinct shape and gives children something to hold above their heads. It seats three and is meant for the 5 to 10 years Key User Group. The product area is 4' x 4' and the safe play area is 10' x 10', so it fits a school or society play area without taking much ground. The finish is multi colour. Our 3-year warranty covers galvanised pipe and roto-moulded parts against manufacturing defects, and the bearing has a 1-year warranty. Ask us for a layout drawing showing where it fits."
     }
